     Technology entrepreneurs bring together the technical world and the
business world in a profitable way. Entrepreneurship is a fundamental driver
of the technological innovation process [Burgelman et al., 2004]. In summary,
technology entrepreneurship is about the creation of a new business enterprise
that generates benefits (wealth, jobs, value, progress) for participating parties by
creating unique, new arrangements of resources, including technology, to meet
the needs of customers and society.


